@domenic , it turned out that ObservableArray is not nullable. [1].
Should we change this to FrozenArray so that it can be null?

[1]: WebIDL spec: [https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-nullable-type](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-nullable-type)

This is the thread we talked about random selection for revealing details.
https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9360#discussion_r1267538297

@smaug---- , can you clarify your position about random selection again? Thanks!

Now I removed the logic around `randomIndex`, and all the cross-origin iframe's preventedBackForwardCache value is `kMasked`.
Please take a look.
@petervanderbeken @smaug----

@petervanderbeken @smaug----

We have addressed your feedback and got a few questions.
Could you take a look at them? Thanks!
